XLeRobot kinematic reference
=============================

Joint names and joint ranges in
envs/xlerobot_mujoco/assets/xlerobot_placeholder.xml are adapted from the
XLeRobot MuJoCo model:

  Vector-Wangel/XLeRobot
  simulation/mujoco/xlerobot.xml
  https://github.com/Vector-Wangel/XLeRobot
  https://github.com/Vector-Wangel/XLeRobot/blob/main/simulation/mujoco/xlerobot.xml
  Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
  http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

The STL meshes shipped with that model are not included in this repository.
The MJCF here is an original primitive-geometry placeholder so the gymnasium
environment can load on CPU. See docs/simulation.md before replacing it with
the upstream assets.

LeRobot (https://github.com/huggingface/lerobot) is Apache-2.0 and is used as
an external training dependency. It is not vendored here.
